                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/microsoft-ui-xaml/releases/tag/winui3/release/1.8.12"&gt;WinUI 3 in WinAppSDK 1.8.12&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;WinUI 3 in Windows App SDK 1.8.12 contains no WinUI-specific changes. This final servicing release for version 1.8 fixes a Windows ML issue that could expose an unavailable execution provider on certain Arm64 devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For the complete release details, see the &lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/windows-app-sdk/release-notes/windows-app-sdk-1-8?pivots=stable#version-1812-18260921001" rel="nofollow"&gt;Windows App SDK 1.8.12 release notes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Try it out&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download the &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK/1.8.260921001" rel="nofollow"&gt;1.8.260921001 Windows App SDK NuGet package&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
